{
  "name" : "Gray2016 - The Akt switch model",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a simple, linear, four-compartment ordinary differential equation (ODE) model Akt activation that tracks both the phosphorylation state and the physical location (cytosol, plasma membrane) of Akt.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
